# No Emojis

Never use emoji characters anywhere — not in code, UI, comments, or responses.

If an icon is needed in the UI, create a custom inline SVG component instead.

## Examples

BAD — using an emoji as an icon:
```astro
<span>💰 Budget</span>
```

GOOD — custom SVG icon:
```astro
<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
  <circle cx="8" cy="8" r="7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
  <text x="8" y="12" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9" fill="currentColor">$</text>
</svg>
```

- Custom icons must use `currentColor` so they inherit text color
- Always add `aria-hidden="true"` on decorative icons and a visible label or `aria-label` on interactive ones
